---
import HearthworksLayout from '../../../../layouts/HearthworksLayout.astro';
---

<HearthworksLayout
  title="About — Hearthworks Architecture"
  description="Midwest-rooted architecture practice focused on homes, neighborhood buildings, libraries, workplaces, cafes, and community spaces."
>
  <!-- Intro -->
  <section
    class="py-10 border-b border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/60 dark:bg-gray-950/60"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold">About Hearthworks</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mt-2 max-w-3xl">
        We design places people grow attached to. Our work centers on homes,
        neighborhood buildings, libraries, workplaces, cafes, and community
        spaces—architecture that fits daily life and strengthens the character
        of a place.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mt-2">
        Midwest-rooted (Chicago and Madison) with selected projects on the West
        Coast and in mountain towns.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Practice focus -->
  <section class="py-12">
    <div
      class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"
    >
      <div class="md:col-span-2 space-y-5">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Practice</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          Hearthworks isn’t a luxury firm or a theoretical studio. We focus on
          human-scale architecture: porches and entries that feel welcoming,
          kitchens and offices that work day to day, courtyards and gardens that
          invite people outside, and neighborhood buildings that fit their
          streets.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Where we work</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>
            <strong>Chicago + Madison:</strong> Core residential, mixed-use, library,
            and community projects.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Beyond the region:</strong> Occasional work on the West Coast
            and in mountain towns with local collaborators.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Principles</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
          <li>Neighborhood first: fit the street, the block, the routines.</li>
          <li>
            Material honesty: brick, wood, stone, tile, plaster,
            ironwork—detailed for touch and longevity.
          </li>
          <li>
            Gardens and courtyards: outdoor rooms as part of everyday life.
          </li>
          <li>Repair before replace: adaptive reuse when possible.</li>
          <li>Light, air, and comfortable entries.</li>
          <li>Belonging over novelty.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="space-y-4">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">What we work on</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            {
              [
                'Homes',
                'Neighborhood buildings',
                'Libraries',
                'Workplaces',
                'Cafés',
                'Community spaces',
                'Adaptive reuse',
              ].map((t) => <span class="hw-chip">{t}</span>)
            }
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-2">Based in</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Chicago, IL and Madison, WI — with selected work nationally.
          </p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Approach -->
  <section
    class="py-12 hw-texture border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-semibold mb-4">Approach</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Walk the block</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Understand neighbors, trees, porches, and patterns of use.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Listen to routines</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            What needs to happen here every day? Where do people gather?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Sketch and iterate</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Quick drawings and working mockups to find what fits.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Detail the craft</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Durable, repairable materials; clear joints; good light.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="rounded-lg border border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800 p-4 bg-white/70 dark:bg-gray-900/40"
        >
          <h3 class="font-semibold mb-1">Build what matters</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300">
            Phase if helpful; adapt as the place teaches us.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/concept/hearthworks-architecture/portfolio/"
          class="inline-block px-5 py-3 rounded-md bg-gray-900 text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-gray-900"
          >See the portfolio</a
        >
        <a
          href="/concept/hearthworks-architecture/people/"
          class="inline-block px-5 py-3 rounded-md border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white"
          >Meet the people</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</HearthworksLayout>
